    <div>
      <p begin="00:07.770" end="00:13.910" ttm:agent="v1">Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh</p>
      <p begin="00:13.910" end="00:17.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Nan kkaeeona kkaman bamgwa hamkke (hey)</p>
      <p begin="00:17.350" end="00:20.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Da deuleowa damen nugu chalye (hey)</p>
      <p begin="00:20.880" end="00:24.830" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Han chi apdo bol su eobsneun magjang gelilla (wooh-wooh)</p>
      <p begin="00:24.830" end="00:27.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Gyeongbaehala mogcheongi teojige (ow)</p>
      <p begin="00:27.590" end="00:30.350" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, jjijilhan bunwigileul jeonhwanhae</p>
      <p begin="00:30.350" end="00:32.160" ttm:agent="v1">Gwanggileul gamchuji moshage hae</p>
      <p begin="00:32.160" end="00:33.810" ttm:agent="v1">Namjadeului pumwi yeojadeului gasig</p>
      <p begin="00:33.810" end="00:35.480" ttm:agent="v1">Iyu moleul jasingami bolmanhae</p>
      <p begin="00:35.480" end="00:37.570" ttm:agent="v1">Nan bolan deusi neomunado ppeonppeonhi</p>
      <p begin="00:37.570" end="00:39.490" ttm:agent="v1">Ni momsoge pagodeuneun alleoji</p>
      <p begin="00:39.490" end="00:40.990" ttm:agent="v1">Isanghan jeongsinui sulleongineun cheonji</p>
      <p begin="00:40.610" end="00:43.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Oneul yeogi mubeobji (wooh)</p>
      <p begin="00:43.300" end="00:46.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Nan buleul jilleo (wooh), ne simjangeul taewo (wooh)</p>
      <p begin="00:46.920" end="00:50.090" ttm:agent="v1">Neol michige hago sipeo</p>
      <p begin="00:50.090" end="00:54.960" ttm:agent="v1">B-i-g, yeah, we bang like this modu da gati</p>
      <p begin="00:54.960" end="00:56.620" ttm:agent="v1">Chong majeun geoscheoleom</p>
